{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-122-1","title":"Psalms 122:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David professes his joy for the church; 6 and prays for the peace thereof.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A Song of degrees. 120:1; 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; 128:1; *titles 129:1; 130:1; 131:1; 132:1; 133:1; 134:1; *titles was glad. 42:4; 55:14; 63:1-3; 84:1,2,10; 119:111 Let us go. Isa 2:3; Jer 31:6; 50:4,5; Mic 4:2; Zec 8:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-2","title":"Psalms 122:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>84:7; 87:1-3; 100:4; Ex 20:24; 2Ch 6:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-3","title":"Psalms 122:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>builded. 2Sa 5:9; Eph 2:20,21; 4:4-7; Re 21:10-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-4","title":"Psalms 122:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Whither. 78:68; 132:13; Ex 23:17; 34:23,24; De 12:5,11; 16:16 the testimony. Ex 16:34; 26:33,34; 32:15 to give. 66:13-16; 107:1-3; 116:17-19; 118:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-5","title":"Psalms 122:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>there. De 17:8,18; 2Ch 19:8 are set. Heb. do sit. the thrones. 2Sa 8:18; 2Ch 11:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-6","title":"Psalms 122:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Pray. 51:18; 137:6,7; Jer 51:50; Joh 17:21; Eph 4:3; 2Th 3:16 they shall. Ge 12:3; Nu 24:9; 1Jo 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-7","title":"Psalms 122:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Peace. 1Ch 12:18; Isa 9:7; 54:13; Joh 14:27; Jas 3:18 within thy palaces. 48:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-8","title":"Psalms 122:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>16:3; 42:4; 119:63; Eph 4:4-6; Php 2:2-5; Jas 3:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-122-9","title":"Psalms 122:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":122,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":122,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the house. 26:8; 69:9; 84:1,2,10; 1Ch 29:3; Joh 2:17 I will seek. 102:13,14; 137:5,6; Ne 2:10; 13:14</p>"}]}